ƒgascribeƒgproduct‚dbasefEntityƒgproduct‚fvectorƒgproduct‚dbasefEntityƒgproductƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunitdmark‚fvectorƒhgrounded‚dbasefEntity‚dbasefEntityƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;99wmDiJJvHEfDcalbMEQ0-lacRnizFwa97X_IfnG_Ewƒdpairƒfvectorƒgproduct‚dbasefEntityƒgproductƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunitdmark˜Ìƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;99wmDiJJvHEfDcalbMEQ0-lacRnizFwa97X_IfnG_Ewƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;qHH5WScOykzW0SVK6FRVf-tJXYqxyrsDEBZA3ltGR_Yƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxBni:///sha-256;YQgYjWpapNNSLass4p5xAwYt1m5oHVoyf8epvd1raKU.productsƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;KTQs8ih43p5TKyLhsBalzwphmEkRP_zMKmcVmrkYChkƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;ZrIN9FIbht7qhyfz8o0Wa7gzd6y3CAH4Gug4kUiZi2Qƒdpairƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;rlu1WUbFkM9QLV7-sFMwjgdMkRiPUzUknN4U0wmlay8ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx3decolonization-geometry-football-cup-final-6a4684f5ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;h6-H7sTulFe0-yjWRcoQuwtdabBaI75K2Di9QvwDCdEƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;U-_3mCB2rkzSNcSdI0ZkSZXBOqUVGegl5FBLzPhnWWYƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkhtool_useƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;1A9bny-0Tjqp7Xu6rJsvGsZvk3lpRX56kJORRyeTf60ƒdpairƒerightdu