tribute: https://africasacountry.com/2026/07/odyssey-to-africas-last-colony)\n  - [claim:odyssey-to-africa-s-last-colony:2] Odyssey to Africaâ€™s last colony: Yet beyond this contrived spectacle lies a far more important criticism to be made of the filmmakers: their decision to shoot part of the movie in Africaâ€™s last colony, Western Sahara. (attribute: https://africasacountry.com/2026/07/odyssey-to-africas-last-colony)\n  - [claim:odyssey-to-africa-s-last-colony:3] Odyssey to Africaâ€™s last colony: Enjoying generous subsidies from the Moroccan state, they lent legitimacy to its illegal occupation regime. (attribute: https://africasacountry.com/2026/07/odyssey-to-africas-last-colony)\n  - [claim:odyssey-to-africa-s-last-colony:4] Odyssey to Africaâ€™s last colony: As Nolan and his crew filmed along the coast around the port city of Dakhla last summer, an open letter condemning the move was signed by prominent figures in world cinema, including Javier Bardem, Pedro AlmodÃ³var, and Paul Laverty. (attribute: https://africasacountry.com/2026/07/odyssey-to-africas-last-colony)\n  - [claim:odyssey-to-africa-s-last-colony:5] Odyssey to Africaâ€™s last colony: Nolan filmed there without the consent of the Sahrawi people,â€ it read, in reference to the majority nationality in Western Sahara. (attribute: https://africasacountry.com/2026/07/odyssey-to-africas-last-colony)\n  - [claim:odyssey-to-africa-s-last-colony:6] Odyssey to Africaâ€™s last colony: â€ In particular, Oscar-winning actor Bardem did not hold back. (attribute: https://africasacountry.com/2026/07/odyssey-to-africas-last-colony)\n  - [claim:odyssey-to-africa-s-last-colony:7] Odyssey to Africaâ€™s last colony: As he posted the letter on his Instagram account, he added: â€œFor 50 years, Morocco has occupied Western Sahara, expelling the Sahrawi people from their cities. (attribute: https://africasacountry.com/2026/07/odyssey-to-africas-last-colony)\n  - [claim:odyssey-to-africa-s-last-colony:8] Odyssey to Africaâ€™s last colony: â€ Covering an area the size of Britain, Western Sahara is designated as a â€œnon-self-governing territoryâ€ by the United Nations and remains on its official list of territories still awaiting decolonization. (attribute: https://africasacountry.com/2026/07/odyssey-to-africas-last-colony)\n  - [claim:odyssey-to-africa-s-last-colony:9] Odyssey to Africaâ€™s last colony: Retained by Francisco Francoâ€™s Spain even as other European colonies won their freedom, it did not gain independence even after the dictatorâ€™s demise in 1975. (attribute: https://africasacountry.com/2026/07/odyssey-to-africas-last-colony)\n  - [claim:odyssey-to-africa-s-last-colony:10] Odyssey to Africaâ€™s last colony: Instead, neighboring Morocco and Mauritania invaded â€” with at least 40 percent of the Sahrawi population at the time fleeing to neighboring Algeria to escape the Moroccan air forceâ€™s bombing campaign. (attribute: https://africasacountry.com/2026/07/odyssey-to-africas-last-colony)\n  - [claim:odyssey-to-africa-s-last-colony:11] Odyssey to Africaâ€™s last colony: Half a century later, 173,000 Sahrawis still remain in Algerian refugee camps. (attribute: https://africasacountry.com/2026/07/odyssey-to-africas-last-colony)\n  - [claim:odyssey-to-africa-s-last-colony:12] Odyssey to Africaâ€™s last colony: The native Sahrawis living under Moroccan occupation are subject to what Freedom House categorizes as among the least free political systems on the planet. (attribute: https://africasacountry.com/2026/07/odyssey-to-africas-last-colony)\n  - [claim:odyssey-to-africa-s-last-colony:13] Odyssey to Africaâ€™s last colony: The Odyssey is the first major Hollywood production to shoot scenes in Western Sahara. (attribute: https://africasacountry.com/2026/07/odyssey-to-africas-last-colony)\n  - [claim:odyssey-to-africa-s-last-colony:14] Odyssey to Africaâ€™s last colony: This would have been unthinkable prior to 2020, when President Donald Trump broke with decades of US